{
  "name": "dsh-550c-skin",
  "version": "0.1.0-beta.3",
  "description": "550C 皮肤：把 DeepSeek Harness 的整个界面换成 550C 控制台——四套磷光配色（琥珀/绿/青/白）、扫描线与暗角、等宽字体、机器读数栏，与 dsh-550c-boot 的开机片头同一套视觉。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "CREDITS.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": {
    "name": "Ziyang Song",
    "url": "https://github.com/yannicksong0106"
  },
  "contributors": [
    {
      "name": "Voidpocket",
      "url": "https://github.com/Voidpocket",
      "comment": "550C 片头动画与配色原稿（dsh-550c-boot 的 assets/550C-source.html）"
    }
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/yannicksong0106/dsh-550c-skin.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/yannicksong0106/dsh-550c-skin#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/yannicksong0106/dsh-550c-skin/issues"
  },
  "publishConfig": {
    "access": "public"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "dsh-550c",
    "550c",
    "suite",
    "skin",
    "theme",
    "皮肤",
    "主题",
    "外观"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "react": "^18.2.0"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "react": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "dsh": {
    "engines": {
      "dsh": ">=0.2.0-rc.1"
    },
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-theme",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    },
    "suite": {
      "id": "dsh-550c",
      "role": "skin",
      "title": "550C",
      "recommends": [
        "dsh-550c-boot"
      ],
      "note": "同一套件的两个插件，可各自独立安装。「550C」设置页由 dsh-550c-boot 提供，本插件只往里加外观相关的行；两者没有任何代码依赖。"
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "node scripts/build.mjs",
    "check": "node --check lib/client.js && node --check lib/index.js",
    "test": "node scripts/build.mjs && node --test test/*.test.mjs",
    "geometry": "node tools/check-geometry.mjs",
    "verify": "node scripts/build.mjs && node --check lib/client.js && node --check lib/index.js && node --test test/*.test.mjs",
    "prepublishOnly": "node scripts/build.mjs && node --check lib/client.js && node --check lib/index.js"
  },
  "dependencies": {},
  "dshWorkshop": {
    "schema": "omdsh-workshop-package/v1",
    "type": "plugin",
    "integration": {
      "protocol": "harness-profile",
      "artifact": "cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "install": {
      "mode": "transactional",
      "adapter": "profile-bundle",
      "failurePolicy": "generation-rollback",
      "touchesCurrentBeforeActivation": false
    },
    "lifecycle": {
      "activation": "restart-profile",
      "dispose": "supported"
    },
    "permissions": [
      "web:index-inject",
      "web:http-route",
      "network:npm-registry",
      "browser:local-storage",
      "dom:overlay"
    ],
    "compatibility": {
      "dshVersions": [
        "0.2.0-rc.1",
        "0.2.0-rc.2"
      ]
    },
    "capability": {
      "id": "skin-550c",
      "kind": "ui",
      "invocation": "Boot the profile's Web GUI, then switch the skin from 设置 → 550C → 外观: it registers four phosphor schemes plus scan-line / vignette / panel treatments on the theme service, and keeps the choice in lib/index.js's state file.",
      "expected": "The whole shell repaints in the chosen 550C scheme (amber / green / cyan / white) with its scan line, vignette and monospace treatment; the choice survives a restart, and 设置 → 550C → 外观 also shows this package version and can check npm for a newer one."
    },
    "evidence": {
      "install": null,
      "failureIsolation": null,
      "hotReload": null,
      "remove": null
    }
  }
}
